\description{
Chains quality control (\code{\link[=run_qc]{run_qc()}}), sample distance/PCA
(\code{\link[=run_distance_pca]{run_distance_pca()}}), differential expression, gene set enrichment, the
optional modules and an HTML report (\code{\link[=render_report]{render_report()}}) into a single call,
in one of two modes:
}
\details{
\describe{
\item{\code{mode = "wald"} (default)}{Wald tests for every contrast in the grid
built from \code{var} (\code{\link[=run_diffexp_pipeline]{run_diffexp_pipeline()}}), ranked GSEA
(\code{\link[=run_gsea_pipeline]{run_gsea_pipeline()}}).}
\item{\code{mode = "lrt"}}{Likelihood-ratio tests of \code{time} and/or \code{var}
over the nested full/reduced grid from \code{\link[=expand_lrt_specs]{expand_lrt_specs()}}
(\code{\link[=run_diffexp_lrt_pipeline]{run_diffexp_lrt_pipeline()}}). Significant genes (\code{padj < alpha}) are
clustered with \code{DEGreport::degPatterns()} (x = \code{time}, colour = first
of \code{var}); the clusters drive per-cluster ORA
(\code{\link[=run_cluster_ora_pipeline]{run_cluster_ora_pipeline()}}), STRING PPI, CSPA heatmaps and the
per-cluster decoupleR / VIPER signatures, scored by the LRT statistic.}
}

For TPM / FPKM data use \code{\link[=run_limma]{run_limma()}}; for a pre-computed DEG table use
\code{\link[=run_deg]{run_deg()}}.

Optional modules (default off): \code{run_gsva}, \code{run_wgcna}, \code{run_decoupler_tf},
\code{run_decoupler_ccc}, \code{run_viper}. Other stages always run: GSEA / cluster
ORA, CSPA (\code{run_cspa = TRUE}), and STRING PPI via \code{\link[=run_ppi_pipeline]{run_ppi_pipeline()}}
for every DE contrast and (when enabled) every WGCNA module. PPI needs
network access on first run to download STRING files; failures are caught
with a warning so the rest of the pipeline still finishes.

Statistical and plotting thresholds (LFC shrinkage, \code{alpha}, the LFC
cutoff, heatmap/barplot sizes, WGCNA module size, hub/TF/marker counts)
are fixed -- see \code{.pipeline_const}. Call the module functions directly
(\code{\link[=run_diffexp_pipeline]{run_diffexp_pipeline()}}, \code{\link[=run_wgcna_pipeline]{run_wgcna_pipeline()}}, ...) to change them.
}
